  <p>You can use the Service through AI clients such as Google Gemini, ChatGPT and Claude, or editors such as Cursor. These clients are made by other companies. When you connect a server, your client sends our tools the arguments you or the AI model supply, and receives the tool results you ask for. Your use of an AI client is governed by its provider's own terms and privacy policy. We do not control what an AI model asks for, what it writes, or how it presents a tool result, and we are not responsible for the AI client.</p>
  <p>Payments are processed by Stripe. Links to other services, such as GitHub, Telegram, Buy Me a Coffee and PayPal, lead to sites with their own terms.</p>

